# Emitter coverage run (src/xbox/PUSH-BC-PLAN.md section 5.10, C-EMIT):
# the 1P arcade match of arcade-match.pad (Tomb deathmatch, bots), then
# input that makes the non-model drawing sources work: firing and moving
# (muzzle flashes, bullets, impacts, explosions, pickups, the HUD and its
# hit flashes), the pause menu opened and walked (in-match menuGfx, text,
# fills, fades), and the match resumed. For TS_NATIVE_EMIT_SELFCHECK runs
# (emitdiff = 0) and the [TS:emit] fields of [TS:render]
# (make AUTOPLAY=src/xbox/test/arcade-emit.pad).
#
# Unverified until the test session: the read counts of the in-match part
# are first guesses (screenshots at the marked reads confirm what is on
# screen).
#
# Format (ps2_pad.cpp):
#   <reads> <buttons> [lx ly rx ry]
#   wait_u32 <guest-address> <comparison> <value>
#   repeat <n> ... end
# In a match the left stick moves (ly 0 forward, lx strafes), the right
# stick turns (rx), R1 fires, cross respawns.

40 none
2 start
8 none
2 cross
